WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.250
SCP-682 Vs SCP-1915.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.840
Could the Hard to Destroy Reptile finally
be minimized by an accountant that’s anomalously

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.201
attached to the status quo?

00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:16.030
SCP-1915 is a man who has the anomalous effect
of transforming everything around him to suit

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.650
his own perception of the status quo.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.269
As such, he doesn’t even know he’s contained,
he thinks the site is an office where he just

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:24.529
happens to work.

00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:29.759
When SCP-1915 was sent in to file some tax
papers in an office that just so happened

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:35.630
to be 682’s containment chamber, the room
and 682 itself began to gradually transform.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:52.100
It became a komodo dragon, then an iguana,
then a newt

